# Only known, accounted-for things are ignored here: software/tool
# byproducts, and the canonical set of DevLab + project repos. Everything
# else -- any folder or file a person drops into home that isn't on this
# list -- is meant to show up as untracked in a plain `git status`, with
# no flag, so it gets noticed and dealt with.
#
# Project repos are ignored (not tracked/added) here on purpose: each one
# has its own .git and its own status/diff; this file's only job is to
# flag what doesn't belong.

# dotfiles: shell/app state, caches, credentials
.*
!/.gitignore

# DevLab-managed proot containers (DevLab.py KNOWN), rebuilt on demand
/DEBIAN-13
/UBUNTU-24
/FEDORA-44

# Termux SD card mount and its symlink
/sdcard
/storage

# docs and tokens kept directly in home (the .txt files are raw GitHub
# tokens -- never to be tracked, since this repo is public)
/*.md
/*.txt

# the canonical project repos
/AIofZen
/Astro
/ChatPad
/Date
/Fonts
/Fonts-dev
/Hebrew
/HebrewDate-android
/InferenceServer
/MediaTools
/ProjectPad
/Psalms-android
/ReubenInstitute.github.io
/Scinova.github.io
/Scriptures
/ScripturesStudio
/StyledScriptures
/TheStrip
/UsbThing-android
/VAULT
/Vendix
/audiobible-shmueloff-source
/audiobible-titles
/ffmpeg-python
/reubeninstitute-css
/reubeninstitute-fonts
/uqsadeuqsa.github.io
